update public.news_updates set summary='OFSI has published General Licence INT/2026/9491628, setting out the permitted activities, conditions and reporting requirements for persons relying on the licence under the UK financial sanctions regime.', full_summary='OFSI has published General Licence INT/2026/9491628, setting out the permitted activities, conditions and reporting requirements for persons relying on the licence under the UK financial sanctions regime.', source_url='https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/ofsi-general-licence-int20269491628', updated_at=now() where id='0bbafab1-4be2-42df-9af0-fc0d503c7a13';
update public.news_updates set summary='Sumsub, a RegTech company providing identity verification and compliance technology, has partnered with Innovation City, a UAE free zone for AI, Web3 and digital asset businesses, to help international companies establish compliant operations in the UAE from the outset. The partnership provides businesses setting up through Innovation City with access to Sumsub’s compliance and verification services.', full_summary='Sumsub, a RegTech company providing identity verification and compliance technology, has partnered with Innovation City, a UAE free zone for AI, Web3 and digital asset businesses, to help international companies establish compliant operations in the UAE from the outset. The partnership provides businesses setting up through Innovation City with access to Sumsub’s compliance and verification services.', source_url='https://fintech.global/2026/07/01/sumsub-expands-uae-compliance-through-innovation-city-partnership/', updated_at=now() where id='22509556-b6b7-4ebc-a948-d6ea8c5b3614';
update public.news_updates set summary='The EU''s latest sanctions package targets refineries in Georgia and Belarus over their links to Russian crude oil, extending restrictions on the processing and re-export of Russian-origin petroleum products.', full_summary='The EU''s latest sanctions package targets refineries in Georgia and Belarus over their links to Russian crude oil, extending restrictions on the processing and re-export of Russian-origin petroleum products.', source_url='https://www.spglobal.com/energy/en/news-research/latest-news/crude-oil/072426-eu-targets-georgian-belarusian-refineries-under-new-sanctions-package', updated_at=now() where id='adbbf840-5a9f-4123-b61c-9fdf6e02ef03';
update public.news_updates set summary='OFAC sanctions individuals and entities aiding North Korea''s cyber fraud schemes, linking them to major cryptocurrency exploits and illicit financial activities.', full_summary='OFAC sanctions individuals and entities aiding North Korea''s cyber fraud schemes, linking them to major cryptocurrency exploits and illicit financial activities.', source_url='https://www.elliptic.co/insights/ofac-sanctions-a-fraud-network-for-assisting-the-north-korean-dprk-regime/', updated_at=now() where id='7a937aa6-dc0d-44b4-bc2c-27773b39afc0';
update public.news_updates set summary='Tabby, the financial services app, announced it has received a consumer finance licence and an SME finance licence from the Saudi Central Bank (SAMA).', full_summary='Tabby, the financial services app, today announced it has received a consumer finance licence and SME finance licence from the Saudi Central Bank (SAMA). The licences let Tabby offer customers in Saudi Arabia longer plans on larger purchases, alongside the 4 interest-free monthly payments they already use, and provide working capital to businesses. For customers, longer payment plans are already live across Tabby''s retailers including Noon, Fitness Time, Almanea, IKEA, Almosafer, Almatar and flynas, on purchases over SAR 2,000 with limits of up to SAR 50,000.', source_url='https://financialit.net/news/infrastructure/tabby-secures-finance-licences-saudi-central-bank', updated_at=now() where id='28eccec1-dc8c-4466-bfc7-175d34b34cba';
update public.news_updates set summary='The entity was found to have violated the regulator''s market conduct and consumer protection regulations.', full_summary='The entity was found to have violated the regulator''s market conduct and consumer protection regulations.', source_url='https://www.thenationalnews.com/business/banking/2026/07/06/uae-central-bank-fines-foreign-bank-dh18m-for-regulatory-breach/', updated_at=now() where id='1cefe9fc-9dc4-414e-bc94-0136c21d0c9d';
update public.news_updates set summary='On 23 July 2026, the Council of the European Union adopted its 21st package of restrictive measures against Russia, amending Regulation (EU) 833/2014 and Regulation (EU) 269/2014.', full_summary='On 23 July 2026, the Council of the European Union adopted its 21st package of restrictive measures against Russia, amending Regulation (EU) 833/2014 and Regulation (EU) 269/2014. The priority development for members to note is that the EU has for the first time expanded the listing criteria to include vessels that service shadow fleet ships, whether or not designated. More broadly, the package comprises 218 individual and entity listings (170 entities and 48 individuals) including 94 Russian banks and financial institutions, which is the largest number of designations in a single package in four years, together with a range of sectoral, trade, financial and anti-circumvention measures.', source_url='https://www.skuld.com/topics/legal/sanctions/russia/eu-sanctions-21st-sanctions-package-against-russia/', updated_at=now() where id='0fb57328-1014-4765-a11a-06dd06b60c9f';
update public.news_updates set summary='The United States imposed fresh sanctions targeting Iran’s financial networks even as US officials said progress had been made toward a deal with Tehran over the Strait of Hormuz.', full_summary='The United States imposed fresh sanctions targeting Iran’s financial networks even as US officials said progress had been made toward a deal with Tehran over the Strait of Hormuz and it could be clinched as early as the weekend.', source_url='https://www.iranintl.com/en/202608072875', updated_at=now() where id='f120922f-3807-47cb-96d8-8ea17b82fa4e';
update public.news_updates set summary='Signs of a marked acceleration in UK sanctions enforcement continue to emerge. In the months since the last update, the Office of Financial Sanctions Implementation (OFSI) has deployed its new settlement scheme across multiple cases.', full_summary='Signs of a marked acceleration in UK sanctions enforcement continue to emerge. In the months since the last update, the Office of Financial Sanctions Implementation (OFSI) has deployed its new settlement scheme across multiple cases.', source_url='https://www.traverssmith.com/knowledge/knowledge-container/uk-sanctions-update-enforcement-momentum-accelerates-as-ofsi-deploys-new-powers-and-looks-beyond-russia/', updated_at=now() where id='b4f80982-44a7-4047-9156-479eee6f77f8';
update public.news_updates set summary='The Council of the EU strengthened its Sudan sanctions regime by adding gold trade to the listing criteria, allowing designations of individuals and entities financing the conflict through gold extraction, trading and export.', full_summary='The Council of the EU strengthened its Sudan sanctions regime by adding gold trade to the listing criteria, allowing designations of individuals and entities financing the conflict through gold extraction, trading and export.', source_url='https://www.consilium.europa.eu/en/press/press-releases/2026/07/13/sudan-council-strengthens-eu-sanctions-regime-by-targeting-gold-trade/', updated_at=now() where id='36ad5d2a-801b-4a27-99c3-00df8692d506';
update public.news_updates set summary='OFAC and OFSI have published a joint comparative overview of the United States’ and United Kingdom’s sanctions regimes.', full_summary='The US Department of the Treasury’s Office of Foreign Assets Control (OFAC) and His Majesty’s Treasury’s Office of Financial Sanctions Implementation (OFSI) have published a joint comparative overview of the United States’ and United Kingdom’s sanctions regimes. A reflection of the increasingly close cooperation between the two authorities, the publication is intended to help businesses operating across both jurisdictions understand their respective compliance obligations.', source_url='https://www.morganlewis.com/pubs/2026/07/ofac-and-ofsi-issue-joint-comparative-overview-of-us-and-uk-sanctions-regimes', updated_at=now() where id='d67098f8-dcf0-4465-bf4d-b8cd766116ca';
update public.news_updates set summary='BCL''s latest Sanctions and Export Controls fortnightly summary highlights the key UK and international developments from the past fortnight.', full_summary='BCL''s latest Sanctions and Export Controls fortnightly summary highlights the key UK and international developments from the past fortnight across the EU, UK and US regimes.', source_url='https://www.bcl.com/news/sanctions-and-export-controls-round-up-eu-uk-and-us-highlights', updated_at=now() where id='beca6244-d073-47a0-97fa-e761e5b5c399';
